<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>{{ site_name }}</title>
{% for stylesheet in site_assets.stylesheets %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ stylesheet }}">{% endfor %}
{% for module in site_assets.modules %}<script type="module" src="{{ module }}"></script>{% endfor %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/default-site.css"></head>
<body class="kumwe-welcome"><a class="sr-only" href="#site-content">Skip to content</a>
<header class="site-header"><div class="site-container site-header-inner"><a class="site-brand" href="/"><span class="welcome-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>{{ site_name }}</span></a><nav class="welcome-header-nav" aria-label="Welcome navigation"><a href="#capabilities">Capabilities</a><a href="#platform">Platform</a><a class="welcome-header-action" href="/administrator">Administrator</a></nav></div></header>
<main class="site-main" id="site-content">
<section class="welcome-hero"><div class="site-container welcome-hero-grid"><div class="welcome-hero-copy"><p class="welcome-kicker">Kumwe CMS 2.0</p><h1>Content systems <span>ready for what comes next.</span></h1><p class="welcome-lead">A modern publishing foundation for teams that need structured content, governed workflows, and the freedom to deliver through the browser, APIs, automation, and AI.</p><div class="welcome-actions"><a class="welcome-primary" href="/administrator">Open administrator <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></a><a class="welcome-secondary" href="#capabilities">Explore the platform <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 8 4 4 4-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></a></div><ul class="welcome-proof-list"><li>Visual administration</li><li>Structured content</li><li>Governed publishing</li><li>Extensible by design</li></ul></div>
<div class="welcome-workspace" role="img" aria-label="Kumwe publishing workspace preview"><div class="workspace-bar"><span class="workspace-dot"></span><span class="workspace-dot"></span><span class="workspace-dot"></span><strong>Publishing workspace</strong></div><div class="workspace-panel"><div class="workspace-header"><div><p>Editorial overview</p><strong>Everything moving, nothing lost.</strong></div><span class="workspace-live">Live</span></div><div class="workspace-metrics"><div class="workspace-metric"><span>Published</span><strong>128</strong></div><div class="workspace-metric"><span>In review</span><strong>12</strong></div><div class="workspace-metric"><span>Scheduled</span><strong>8</strong></div></div><div class="workspace-flow"><div class="workspace-flow-title">Publishing workflow <span>Page · v6</span></div><div class="workspace-stages"><span class="workspace-stage">Draft</span><span class="workspace-stage is-active">Review</span><span class="workspace-stage">Published</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="welcome-section" id="capabilities"><div class="site-container"><div class="welcome-section-heading"><div><p class="welcome-overline">A complete content foundation</p><h2>Structure once.<br>Publish with confidence.</h2></div><p>Kumwe brings editorial clarity and engineering discipline into the same system, so teams can move quickly without giving up control, portability, or long-term maintainability.</p></div><div class="welcome-card-grid"><article class="welcome-card"><span class="welcome-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h14v16H5zM8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span><h3>Editor-first administration</h3><p>Graphical fields, media, navigation, search, and responsive workflows let non-technical teams run the site without raw payloads or developer intervention.</p><span class="welcome-card-meta">Designed for daily work</span></article><article class="welcome-card"><span class="welcome-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 12 3 3 7-7M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.4 8-8 9-4.6-1-8-4-8-9V7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span><h3>Governed publishing</h3><p>Defined states, transitions, revisions, permissions, scheduling, and audit trails keep every change deliberate, visible, and recoverable.</p><span class="welcome-card-meta">Control without friction</span></article><article class="welcome-card"><span class="welcome-card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 6 3 12l5 6M16 6l5 6-5 6M14 4l-4 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7"/></svg></span><h3>Open, extensible architecture</h3><p>Templates, extensions, REST, CLI, MCP, workers, and portable database support make Kumwe a durable base for websites and serious application portals.</p><span class="welcome-card-meta">Built to evolve</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="welcome-platform" id="platform"><div class="site-container welcome-platform-grid"><div class="welcome-platform-copy"><p class="welcome-overline">One coherent platform</p><h2>One content core. Every delivery surface.</h2><p>The same authorization, content, navigation, and extension rules power every interface. No duplicated business logic. No separate truth.</p></div><div class="welcome-surface-list"><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">UI</span><span><strong>Browser</strong><span>Public site and administrator</span></span></div><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">API</span><span><strong>REST</strong><span>Typed application integration</span></span></div><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">CLI</span><span><strong>Command line</strong><span>Operations and automation</span></span></div><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">MCP</span><span><strong>AI-ready tools</strong><span>Scoped intelligent workflows</span></span></div><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">JOB</span><span><strong>Workers</strong><span>Durable background execution</span></span></div><div class="welcome-surface"><span class="welcome-surface-mark">DB</span><span><strong>Portable data</strong><span>MariaDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL</span></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="welcome-final"><div class="site-container"><div class="welcome-final-card"><div><p class="welcome-overline">Your installation is ready</p><h2>Turn this foundation into your site.</h2><p>Open the administrator, create your first page, add it to navigation, and choose it as the homepage. This welcome presentation will step aside automatically.</p></div><a class="welcome-primary" href="/administrator">Start building <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></a></div></div></section>
</main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-container welcome-footer-inner"><span class="welcome-footer-brand"><span class="welcome-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Kumwe CMS</span><p>Structured content. Governed publishing. Open delivery.</p></div></footer></body></html>
